# Raw run data is regenerated per run and is large; only reports are tracked. The blind-judge labels and their
# URL lists are the exception: they are the regression set contrast.py re-scores, and cannot be recreated.
runs/*
!runs/*.judge.json
!runs/*.urls.json
# Page texts and verbatim tool results are raw data; only the per-topic result*.json and summary.json are tracked.
fidelity/*/*.txt
fidelity/*/*.tmp
